From f7083a8cbd5e2839d8a90d7df559a1fbd9ccddc8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 20:02:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] stage: route chat to an external Cortico brain when enabled
 (from moeru-ai/airi#2634)

Reduced to the stage-side store, the early-return switches in chat.ts,
context-bridge.ts and the character orchestrator, and the shared frame
schema. Excludes the bridge package, spark/channel client, memory settings
page, i18n and vendor patch. Voice-input routing (stage-web index.vue) is
omitted; main has diverged there.

Original work by peachoolong-uwu in moeru-ai/airi#2634.
